{
 "description": "A design's retained revisions, newest first: each one's number, who made it, when, the operation that produced it (`setProperty \u00d72, insertNode`, `undo`, `restored r3`) and its document digest. `retention` says how far back the history still reaches \u2014 older revisions are gone, and get, diff, restore and fork stop at that floor. Page with `before`. Read access.",
